  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "5",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2KI 5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Naamani Awonyezebwa Ebigenge",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo waaliwo omusajja erinnya lye nga ye Naamani eyali omuduumizi w'eggye lya kabaka w'e Busuuli",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", nga musajja wa maanyi mu maaso ga mukama we, era ng'ayagalibwa nnyo, kubanga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.5.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.5.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yali awadde Busuuli obuwanguzi ku lulwe. Yali muserikale muzira ddala; naye nga mugenge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo mu biro ebyo Abasuuli ne balumba Isirayiri, ne bawamba omuwala omuto okuva mu Isirayiri, n'aweerezanga mukazi wa Naamani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuwala n'agamba mugole we nti, \"Singa mukama wange Naamani agenda n'alaba nnabbi ali mu Samaliya, nnabbi oyo yandiyinzizza okumuwonya ebigenge bye.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Naamani n'agenda n'ategeeza mukama we ebigambo by'omuwala eyava mu Isirayiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabaka wa Busuuli n'amuddamu nti, \"Genda kaakano, era ogende n'ebbaluwa gye nnaawandiikira kabaka wa Isirayiri",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".\" Awo Naamani n'asitula, n'atwala kilo bisatu mu ana eza ffeeza, ne kilo nsanvu eza zaabu, n'ebika by'engoye eby'enjawulo kkumi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era n'atwalira kabaka wa Isirayiri ebbaluwa, ng'egamba nti, \"Nkuweerezza ebbaluwa eno n'omuweereza wange Naamani omuwonye ebigenge bye.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabaka wa Isirayiri olwasoma ebbaluwa, n'ayuza ebyambalo bye, n'ayogera nti, \"Ndi Katonda, atta era awonya, omusajja ono alyoke ampeereze omusajja we mmuwonye ebigenge bye? Mulaba bw'ansosonkerezaako oluyombo?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erisa omusajja wa Katonda bwe yawulira nti kabaka wa Isirayiri ayuzizza ebyambalo bye, n'amutumira ng'agamba nti, \"Lwaki oyuzizza ebyambalo byo? Nsindikira omusajja, alyoke ategeere nga mu Isirayiri mulimu nnabbi.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Naamani n'asitula n'embalaasi ze n'amagaali ge n'ayimirira ku luggi lw'ennyumba ya Erisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erisa n'atuma omubaka okumugamba nti, \"Genda, onaabe mu Yoludaani emirundi musanvu, onoowonyezebwa, omubiri gwo ne gudda buto.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Naamani n'anyiiga, n'agenda nga yeemulugunya nti, \"Ndowoozezza nti anaavaayo n'ajja, n'ayimirira n'akoowoola erinnya lya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.5.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.5.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda we, n'awuba omukono gwe ku bitundu ebirina ebigenge, n'amponya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abana ne Faafa, emigga gy'e Damasiko tegisinga amazzi gonna ag'omu Isirayiri? Lwaki sinaabira mu gyo ne mponyezebwa?\" N'akyuka n'agenda ng'ajjudde obusungu bungi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye abaddu ba Naamani ne bamusemberera, ne bamugamba nti, \"Kitaffe, singa nnabbi yakulagidde okukola ekyobuzira, tewandikikoze? Lwaki kikukaluubiridde bw'akugambye nti, 'Nnaaba obe mulongoofu?' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'aserengeta n'agenda ne yebbika mu Yoludaani emirundi musanvu, ng'omusajja wa Katonda bwe yamulagira, n'aba mulongoofu, omubiri gwe ne guba ng'ogw'omwana omuto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Erisa Agaana Ekirabo ky'Aweereddwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Naamani n'ekibinja kye ne baddayo eri omusajja wa Katonda. N'agenda n'ayimirira mu maaso ge, n'ayogera nti, \"Kaakano ntegeeredde ddala nga teri Katonda mu nsi endala zonna wabula mu Isirayiri. Noolwekyo kkiriza ekirabo okuva eri omuddu wo.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nnabbi n'amuddamu nti, \"Mazima ddala, nga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.5.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.5.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gwe mpeereza bw'ali omulamu, siitwale kintu na kimu.\" Naamani n'agezaako okumuwaliriza, naye ye n'agaana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naamani n'amugamba nti, \"Bwe kitaabe bwe kityo, nkwegayiridde omuddu wo aweebwe ettaka eriyinza okusitulibwa ennyumbu bbiri, kubanga omuddu wo taliddayo nate okuwaayo ebiweebwayo ebyokebwa wadde ssaddaaka eri katonda omulala yenna wabula eri",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.5.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.5.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era ne mu nsonga eno",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.5.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.5.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "asaasire omuddu wo; mukama wange bw'anayingira mu ssabo lya Limoni okusinza, ne yeesigama omukono gwange, ne nvuunamira eyo mu ssabo lya Limoni,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.5.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.5.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "asonyiwe omuddu we olw'ensonga eyo.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erisa n'amuddamu nti, \"Genda mirembe.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1",
        "vid": "2KI 5:19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omululu gwa Gekazi n'Ekibonerezo kye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "2KI 5:19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Naye Naamani bwe yali yakagendako ebbanga ttono,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gekazi omuweereza wa Erisa omusajja wa Katonda, n'alowooza mu mutima gwe nti, \"Laba mukama wange bw'asaasidde Naamani ono Omusuuli, n'atakkiriza kirabo kimuweerebbwa. Mazima ddala, nga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.5.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.5.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bw'ali omulamu nzija kumugoberera, mbeeko kye muggyako.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amangwago, Gekazi n'agoberera Naamani. Naamani bwe yamulengera ng'ajja adduka, n'ava mu gaali lye okumusisinkana, n'amubuuza nti, \"Byonna biri bulungi?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'amuddamu nti, \"Byonna biri bulungi, naye mukama wange antumye okukutegeeza nti, 'Wabaddewo bannabbi abavubuka babiri abazze gy'ali okuva mu nsi ey'ensozi eya Efulayimu, era akusabye obaweeko kilo amakumi asatu mu nnya eza ffeeza n'ebika by'engoye bya mirundi ebiri.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naamani n'amugamba nti, \"Tewali kikugaana kutwala kilo nkaaga munaana.\" N'awaliriza Gekazi, n'amusibirako kilo bbiri eza ffeeza mu nsawo bbiri, n'ebika by'engoye bya mirundi ebiri, Naamani n'abitikka abaddu be babiri, abaabyetikka nga bakulembeddemu Gekazi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gekazi bwe yatuuka ku lusozi, n'abibaggyako, n'abiteeka mu nnyumba ye, n'abasindika bagende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ayingira n'ayimirira mu maaso ga Erisa mukama we. Erisa n'amubuuza nti, \"Ova wa Gekazi?\" Gekazi n'addamu nti, \"Omuddu wo taliiko gy'agenze.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Erisa n'amugamba nti, \"Ssaagenze naawe mu mwoyo, omusajja bwe yavudde mu ggaali lye okukusisinkana? Kino ky'ekiseera eky'okutwala ensimbi, oba engoye, oba ennimiro ez'emizeeyituuni, oba ez'emizabbibu, oba endiga, oba ente, oba abaddu, oba abaweereza abawala?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noolwekyo ebigenge bya Naamani binaakuberangako gwe ne bazzukulu bo emirembe gyonna.\" Awo Gekazi n'ava mu maaso ga Erisa nga mugenge, atukula ng'omuzira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
